# Local wiki page staging (pushed to the GitHub wiki repo, not this one)
.wiki-staging/

# Local working notes (never published)
claude-progress.md

# ACPL2 license-signing secret. sync_dist_tools.sh (private acp-dist-tools) writes the
# native-lane key ONLY into this file, next to the vendored, secret-free ACPLicense.h.
# It must never be committed: from 2026-08-10 to 2026-10-07 the key sat in the tracked
# ACPLicense.h here and had to be rotated. CI + .githooks/pre-commit enforce this.
**/ACPDistTools/ACPLicenseSecret.h
**/ACPBuildInfo.h
*.license
